      "english_lyrics": [
        {
          "line": "The Khalsa belongs to God, and victory belongs to God.",
          "time": 24
        },
        {
          "line": "Speech of the poet.",
          "time": 9024
        },
        {
          "line": "Chaupai",
          "time": 10027
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect me O Lord! with Thine own Hands",
          "time": 11096
        },
        {
          "line": "all the desires of my heart be fulfilled.",
          "time": 13077
        },
        {
          "line": "Let my mind rest under Thy Feet",
          "time": 15065
        },
        {
          "line": "Sustain me, considering me Thine own.377.",
          "time": 17042
        },
        {
          "line": "Destroy, O Lord! all my enemies and",
          "time": 19052
        },
        {
          "line": "protect me with Thine won Hands.",
          "time": 22023
        },
        {
          "line": "May my family live in comfort",
          "time": 23085
        },
        {
          "line": "and ease alongwith all my servants and disciples.378.",
          "time": 25077
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect me O Lord! with Thine own Hands",
          "time": 27099
        },
        {
          "line": "and destroy this day all my enemies",
          "time": 30014
        },
        {
          "line": "May all the aspirations be fulfilled",
          "time": 32009
        },
        {
          "line": "Let my thirst for Name remain afresh.379.",
          "time": 34005
        },
        {
          "line": "I may remember none else except Thee",
          "time": 36024
        },
        {
          "line": "And obtain all the required boons from Thee",
          "time": 38030
        },
        {
          "line": "Let my servants and disciples cross the world-ocean",
          "time": 40048
        },
        {
          "line": "All my enemies be singled out and killed.380.",
          "time": 42028
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect me O Lord! with Thine own Hands and",
          "time": 44045
        },
        {
          "line": "relieve me from the fear of death",
          "time": 46062
        },
        {
          "line": "May Thou ever bestow Thy favours on my side",
          "time": 48065
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect me O Lord!Thou, the Supreme Destroyer.381.",
          "time": 50060
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect me, O Lord! Thou, the Protector, O Lord!",
          "time": 52077
        },
        {
          "line": "Most dear, the Protector of the Saints:",
          "time": 54088
        },
        {
          "line": "Friend of the poor and the Destroyer of the enemies",
          "time": 57007
        },
        {
          "line": "Thou art the Master of the fourteen worlds.382.",
          "time": 58098
        },
        {
          "line": "In due time Brahma appeared in physical form",
          "time": 60096
        },
        {
          "line": "In due time Shiva incarnated",
          "time": 63022
        },
        {
          "line": "In due time Vishnu manifested Himself",
          "time": 65050
        },
        {
          "line": "All this is the play of the Temporal Lord.383.",
          "time": 67031
        },
        {
          "line": "The Temporal Lord, who created Shiva, the Yogi",
          "time": 69002
        },
        {
          "line": "Who created Brahma, the Master of the Vedas",
          "time": 71074
        },
        {
          "line": "The Temporal Lord who fashioned the entire world",
          "time": 73097
        },
        {
          "line": "I salute the same Lord.384.",
          "time": 75084
        },
        {
          "line": "The Temporal Lord, who created the whole world",
          "time": 77055
        },
        {
          "line": "Who created gods, demons and yakshas",
          "time": 80008
        },
        {
          "line": "He is the only one from the beginning to the end",
          "time": 82040
        },
        {
          "line": "I consider Him only my Guru.385.",
          "time": 84012
        },
        {
          "line": "I salute Him, none else but Him",
          "time": 86015
        },
        {
          "line": "Who has created Himself and His subjects",
          "time": 88044
        },
        {
          "line": "He bestows Divine virtues and happiness on His servants",
          "time": 90064
        },
        {
          "line": "He destroys the enemies instantly.386.",
          "time": 92095
        },
        {
          "line": "He knows the inner feelings of every heart",
          "time": 94066
        },
        {
          "line": "He knows the anguish of both good and bad",
          "time": 96080
        },
        {
          "line": "From the ant to the mighty elephant",
          "time": 98070
        },
        {
          "line": "He casts His Graceful glance on all and feels pleased.387.",
          "time": 100082
        },
        {
          "line": "He is pained when He sees His saints in grief",
          "time": 102096
        },
        {
          "line": "He is happy when His saints are happy",
          "time": 104093
        },
        {
          "line": "He knows the agony of everyone",
          "time": 106091
        },
        {
          "line": "He knows the innermost secrets of every heart.388.",
          "time": 108086
        },
        {
          "line": "When the Creator projected Himself",
          "time": 110094
        },
        {
          "line": "His creation manifested itself in innumerable forms",
          "time": 112079
        },
        {
          "line": "When at any time He withdraws His creation",
          "time": 114082
        },
        {
          "line": "All the physical forms are merged in Him.389.",
          "time": 116079
        },
        {
          "line": "All the bodies of living beings created in the world",
          "time": 118077
        },
        {
          "line": "Speak about Him according to their understanding",
          "time": 120081
        },
        {
          "line": "But Thou, O Lord! live quite apart from everything",
          "time": 122073
        },
        {
          "line": "This fact is known to the Vedas and the learned.390.",
          "time": 124049
        },
        {
          "line": "The Lord is Formless, Sinless and shelterless:",
          "time": 126068
        },
        {
          "line": "He is the Primal Power, Blemishless, Beginningless and Unborn",
          "time": 129006
        },
        {
          "line": "The fool claims boastfully about the knowledge of His secrets,",
          "time": 131018
        },
        {
          "line": "which even the Vedas do not know.391.",
          "time": 132097
        },
        {
          "line": "The fool considers Him a stone,",
          "time": 134092
        },
        {
          "line": "but the great fool does not know any secret",
          "time": 137034
        },
        {
          "line": "He calls Shiva \"The Eternal Lord,\"",
          "time": 139037
        },
        {
          "line": "but he does not know the secret of the Formless Lord.392.",
          "time": 141027
        },
        {
          "line": "According to one's own intellect,",
          "time": 143046
        },
        {
          "line": "one describes Thee differently",
          "time": 145039
        },
        {
          "line": "The limits of Thy creation cannot be known",
          "time": 147039
        },
        {
          "line": "and how the world was fashioned in the beginning?393.",
          "time": 149024
        },
        {
          "line": "He hath only one unparalleled Form",
          "time": 151048
        },
        {
          "line": "He manifests Himself as a poor man or a king at different places",
          "time": 153055
        },
        {
          "line": "He created creatures from eggs, wombs and perspiration",
          "time": 155039
        },
        {
          "line": "Then He created the vegetable kingdom.394.",
          "time": 157033
        },
        {
          "line": "Somewhere He sits joyfully as a king",
          "time": 159018
        },
        {
          "line": "Somewhere He contracts Himself as Shiva, the Yogi",
          "time": 161036
        },
        {
          "line": "All His creation unfolds wonderful things",
          "time": 163045
        },
        {
          "line": "He, the Primal Power, is from the beginning and Self-Existent.395.",
          "time": 165059
        },
        {
          "line": "O Lord! now keep me under Your protection.",
          "time": 168048
        },
        {
          "line": "Protect my disciples and destroy the wicked ones.",
          "time": 170000
        },
        {
          "line": "All villains who cause disturbances,",
          "time": 171077
        },
        {
          "line": "and all infidels—destroy them in the battlefield.396.",
          "time": 173072
        },
        {
          "line": "O Supreme Destroyer! those who come to Your refuge,",
          "time": 175066
        },
        {
          "line": "their enemies die in great suffering.",
          "time": 177066
        },
        {
          "line": "Those persons who fall at Your Feet,",
          "time": 179078
        },
        {
          "line": "You remove all their troubles.397.",
          "time": 181059
        },
        {
          "line": "Those who meditate even once in this dark age,",
          "time": 183048
        },
        {
          "line": "death cannot come near them.",
          "time": 185056
        },
        {
          "line": "Your protection remains over them at all times,",
          "time": 187088
        },
        {
          "line": "and their enemies and misfortunes end instantly.398.",
          "time": 189088
        },
        {
          "line": "Upon whom You cast Your gracious glance,",
          "time": 191087
        },
        {
          "line": "their sufferings are removed in a moment.",
          "time": 194012
        },
        {
          "line": "All wealth and spiritual powers enter their home,",
          "time": 196046
        },
        {
          "line": "and no enemy can even touch their shadow.399.",
          "time": 198034
        },
        {
          "line": "He who remembers You even once,",
          "time": 200042
        },
        {
          "line": "You save him from the noose of death.",
          "time": 202034
        },
        {
          "line": "Those who utter Your Name,",
          "time": 204046
        },
        {
          "line": "are freed from poverty and wicked influences.400.",
          "time": 206038
        },
        {
          "line": "O The Lord of Sword, I seek Your protection.",
          "time": 208043
        },
        {
          "line": "With Your Hands you have guarded me",
          "time": 210091
        },
        {
          "line": ". At All Times be my Support.",
          "time": 212098
        },
        {
          "line": "Save me from wickedness and pain.",
          "time": 214091
        },
        {
          "line": "The Mother of the world has been kind towards me and I have completed the book this auspicious night;",
          "time": 217041
        },
        {
          "line": "The Lord is the destroyer of all the sins of the body and all the malicious and wicked persons.",
          "time": 221026
        },
        {
          "line": "When Mahakal became kind, He immediately caused me to complete this book;",
          "time": 225008
        },
        {
          "line": "He will obtain the fruit desired by the mind (who will read or listen to this book) and no suffering will occur to him.",
          "time": 229033
        },
        {
          "line": "ARRIL",
          "time": 233034
